Hook the split-KV Triton verify attention and the int8-QK prefill attention
into TRITON_ATTN for unquantized bfloat16 KV caches, so cards running
--attention-backend TRITON_ATTN --kv-cache-dtype bfloat16 (such as ROCm
gfx1100 under CTX=fast) do not fall back to un-split unified_attention on
multi-query speculative verify steps.

Kind: feature
What: hook split-KV verify and int8-QK prefill attention into TRITON_ATTN for bf16 KV caches
Upstream: none
Cut-against: 0.31.0
Retires-when: rides with spec-decode-attn and prefill-attn-int8

